{"id":"d4b44981f101d27c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-indep.md","title":"联合实现有效下维数与上维数","display":"thm-dim-indep — 联合实现有效下维数与上维数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-indep","aliases":["43-thm-dim-indep"],"display":"thm-dim-indep — 联合实现有效下维数与上维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-effhausdim]]","[[43-df-effpackdim]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Athreya–Hitchcock–Lutz–Mayordomo, Effective Strong Dimension, arXiv:cs/0211025v3 (2003-01-06), Thm.6.5, printed pp.13–15 / PDF pp.15–17; https://arxiv.org/pdf/cs/0211025","verification_status":"external-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-indep"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-indep</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-indep — 联合实现有效下维数与上维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Athreya–Hitchcock–Lutz–Mayordomo, Effective Strong Dimension, arXiv:cs/0211025v3 (2003-01-06), Thm.6.5, printed pp.13–15 / PDF pp.15–17; <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/cs/0211025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/cs/0211025</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in[0,1]\">\\(s,t\\in[0,1]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\le t\">\\(s\\le t\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s,t\\in[0,1]\\,[s\\le t\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,(\\dim_H(X)=s\\land\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=t)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s,t\\in[0,1]\\,[s\\le t\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,(\\dim_H(X)=s\\land\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=t)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已对照原作者论文 Theorem 6.5：对任意实数 0≤α≤β≤1，存在 Cantor 序列同时实现 dim=α 与 Dim=β，量词无可计算参数限制。来源证明以随机序列分块并交替填充零串给复杂度上下界；本次核对陈述与构造框架，未独立验证证明全部端点细节。所供书 Cor.17.4.4 只直接陈述有理参数，这里明确属于书外补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effpackdim","status":"resolved","id":"28c411f76cbe3176","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effpackdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,t\\in[0,1]$ 且 $s\\le t$；见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effpackdim","status":"resolved","id":"28c411f76cbe3176","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,t\\in[0,1]$ 且 $s\\le t$；见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s,t\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"s\\le t","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s,t\\in[0,1]\\,[s\\le t\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,(\\dim_H(X)=s\\land\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=t)].","display":true}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-520","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-indep]] — 联合实现有效下维数与上维数"},{"id":"dd4032bef1975d25","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$s\\in[0,1]$；见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-thm-dim-indep]]。"}],"outgoing":["2114b7d641739c3e","28c411f76cbe3176"]}